      "text": "把挂机涨数值融进肉鸽牌组",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "THE FIRST MILLION takes the endlessly satisfying feeling of making numbers go up from idle games and fuses it with the strategic depth and replayability of roguelike deckbuilders.",
