      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "反复失败解锁破局卡牌套路",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "But you will get closer with every try as you constantly unlock new cards and upgrades and discover one game-breaking strategy after another.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4446010/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每日固定牌组比拼最高收益",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "And you can endlessly enjoy a daily mode where you compete with other players to see who can make the most money with a fixed set of cards every day.",
